  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/header.png\" alt=\"一个标题，展示模组名称和一捆TNT。\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pLPt1q20j-8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/overview.png\" alt=\"简介：Boom! 是 Lukopro 和 leftchaotix 制作的模组，添加了你可投掷的自定义炸弹。\" width=\"1024\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1279258/description_e7cde65b-5971-448e-88dd-b56f6615b641.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/upgrades.png\" alt=\"升级与爆破：炸弹拥有提高爆炸威力的等级。达到最大值以真正发挥强大威力。\" width=\"1024\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">当前升级：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">等级1:</span> 基础 TNT<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">等级2:</span> +1 火药<br><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">等级3:</span> +2 火药<br><span style=\"color:#34495e\">等级4:</span> +1 凋骷髅<br><span style=\"color:#34495e\">等级5:</span> +2 凋骷髅<br><span style=\"color:#34495e\">等级6:</span> +3 凋骷髅 或 +1 下界之星</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/modifiers.png\" alt=\"微调与组装：使用内置修改器系统，可在爆破台处自定义炸弹以适应您的需求。\" width=\"1024\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">当前修改器：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ff5e00\">火焰：</span> </span>在爆炸中添加火焰。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#ffffe0\">轻：</span> </span>飞得更远。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#369c7d\">Contained：</span> </span>不会破坏方块。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#5f9c36\">粉碎：</span> </span>破坏更抗性的方块。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#369c7d\">安宁：</span> </span>不对生物造成伤害。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#5f9c36\">致命：</span> </span>对生物造成双倍伤害。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#369c7d\">减弱：</span> </span>不造成击退效果。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#5f9c36\">冲击波：</span> </span>造成双倍击退。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#369c98\">温和：</span> </span>不掉落物品。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#9aa9b5\">蒸发：</span> </span>移除水。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#ffe017\">金：</span> </span>增加爆炸范围。<span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><br><span style=\"color:#7a5c3c\">速射：</span> </span>立即投掷炸弹。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/hoppers.png\" alt=\"自动化：利用漏斗支持快速应用升级和修改器进行批量制作。\" width=\"1024\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">对于<strong>漏斗：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">将炸弹投入爆破台顶部。<br>将升级和修改器投入爆破台侧面。<br>从爆破台底部取出炸弹。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br>对于<strong>发射器：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">小心不要玩得太过开心……你可能会因为这些炸弹而失去几个朋友。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/more.png\" alt=\"更多内容：开发正在进行中，敬请期待更多更新！\" width=\"1024\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">您可以在任何整合包中使用此模组。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请勿重新上传此模组。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lukopro/bombs/refs/heads/main/assets/dynamite_spin.gif\" alt=\"旋转的 TNT\" width=\"77\" height=\"77\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
